{
  "name": "魔法森林",
  "icon": "gensokyolegacy:blue_fir_sapling",
  "category": "gensokyolegacy:nature",
  "advancement": "gensokyolegacy:main/welcome",
  "sortnum": 1,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "魔法之森",
      "text": "高大的青杉与巨型蘑菇遮天蔽日，鬼火菇、梦华菇与妖瘴菇肆意生长，令人脆弱的瘴气弥漫林间，谁人在此安居？"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": [
        "gensokyolegacy:ghost_fire_mushroom",
        "gensokyolegacy:ghost_fire_mushroom_block",
        "gensokyolegacy:cyan_mushroom_stem"
      ],
      "title": "鬼火菇",
      "text": "会发光的蘑菇，照亮林地的地面。每一株菌盖都会自己透出微弱的光，一整片看上去就像挂在树冠下的一排灯笼；成熟的鬼火菇能长到比人还高，立在细长的菌柄上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": [
        "gensokyolegacy:dream_mushroom",
        "gensokyolegacy:dream_mushroom_block",
        "gensokyolegacy:purple_mushroom_stem"
      ],
      "title": "梦华菇",
      "text": "三种里最高最圆的一种，却完全不会发光。梦华菇不透出任何光亮，所以梦华菇的林子即使在正午也总是昏暗的——远远地就能这样认出它们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": [
        "gensokyolegacy:demonic_miasma_mushroom",
        "gensokyolegacy:demonic_miasma_mushroom_block",
        "gensokyolegacy:red_mushroom_stem"
      ],
      "title": "妖瘴菇",
      "text": "最低调的外表，会呼出沉重的瘴气，在菌盖下肆意弥漫，再贴着林地地面蔓延，站在里面绝非好主意，生灵会变得软弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": [
        "gensokyolegacy:blue_fir_sapling",
        "gensokyolegacy:blue_fir_log",
        "gensokyolegacy:blue_fir_wood",
        "gensokyolegacy:blue_fir_leaves"
      ],
      "title": "青杉",
      "text": "寒带林木受湿热气候变化演化而来，高大蜿蜒的树干，层层平展的针叶，星点影布的蘑菇，稀疏垂落的藤蔓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": [
        "gensokyolegacy:eugune_red",
        "gensokyolegacy:eugune_brown",
        "gensokyolegacy:eugune_ghost_fire",
        "gensokyolegacy:evergreen_vine"
      ],
      "title": "耳菇与垂藤",
      "text": "树干生长有耳菇，分三种色；常青垂藤从枝头垂下成长长的串。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": [
        "gensokyolegacy:star_flower",
        "gensokyolegacy:flame_cattail",
        "gensokyolegacy:broom_grass",
        "gensokyolegacy:bracken",
        "gensokyolegacy:mystical_straw",
        "gensokyolegacy:cedar_fallen_leaves"
      ],
      "title": "林地地被",
      "text": "星星花，够得着也够显眼；燃蒲生长在池塘里和岸边；扫帚草像野草般常见；蕨菜混杂其中。魔法森林的地面看起来如同一座没有人打理过的草药库。"
    }
  ]
}